      "options": ["No, never.", "Yes, last weekend.", "Yes, every year."],
      "optionsLang": "en",
      "answer": 0,
      "explain": "*Ben hiç yağlı güreş izlemedim*: *hiç* with a negative past means **never** (so far)."
